  m_Name: ArtsFacts
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FactPack
  category: 3
  facts:
  - Da Vinci painted Mona Lisa.
  - Picasso co-founded Cubism.
  - Beethoven was a composer.
  - Shakespeare wrote Hamlet.
  - The Louvre is in Paris.
  - Michelangelo sculpted David.
  - Van Gogh painted Starry Night.
  - Mozart was a child prodigy.
  - The Oscars are film awards.
  - Jazz originated in New Orleans.
  - Frida Kahlo was Mexican.
  - Homer wrote the Odyssey.
  - Opera started in Italy.
